{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11581","headline":"课小竖鉏斫舍北果林枝蔓荒秽净讫移牀三首 二 · 杜甫","name":"课小竖鉏斫舍北果林枝蔓荒秽净讫移牀三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆壑生寒早，长林卷雾齐。\n青虫悬就日，朱果落封泥。\n薄俗防人面，全身学马蹄。\n吟诗坐回首，随意葛巾低。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}